WEBVTT

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:04.660
Someone once said:

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:04.660
Someone once said:

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:07.410
"Love is...

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.410
"Love is...

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:11.000
the source of a maiden's power."

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:11.000
the source of a maiden's power."

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:45.830
B-boyfriend?!

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:49.620
I-I might not be ready for that yet...

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:52.870
What's a high school girl supposed to do
if she doesn't fall in love?

00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:56.290
Invigorating Drives
Social Observations
A Walk Around the City
Power Spots
Special Support for a Couple's Outing
Where will you go for today's date?

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:56.080
Love is the source of a maiden's power, you know?

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:59.500
Natsuki-chan really is great.

00:01:59.790 --> 00:02:05.540
Her doll-like loveliness, and her pure heart
that indiscriminately interacts with everyone...

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:06.660
She's an angel!

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:09.370
I heard she even has a fan club
for her at another school.

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:14.450
It's obvious that Natsuki-chan is going to win
the beauty contest at this year's school festival, right?

00:02:14.450 --> 00:02:16.450
Well, I dunno about that.

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:19.120
I'm definitely more of an Itsuyo type of guy.

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:22.080
She got inaugurated as student council president
even though she just got admitted to the school!

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:20.910
Student Council
President

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:24.160
She's beautiful! And so charismatic!

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:26.700
There's not a single man who hasn't fallen for her!

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:28.370
I want her to tie me up!

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:32.200
If you wanna talk about popular,
Mutsumi-chan in class C is tops!

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:34.830
She's the latest up-and-coming idol!

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:38.580
Just once, I want to try to talk with her,
even though she rarely comes to school!

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:42.120
Hey, you guys are in the same class
as Natsuki-chan, so support her!

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:43.200
Mutsumi-chan!

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:44.120
Itsuyo-san!

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:44.950
Ugh.

00:02:44.950 --> 00:02:47.160
Still popular as always, aren't you?

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:49.000
How confident are you that you'll win?

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:52.290
I have no interest in that beauty contest.

00:02:52.290 --> 00:02:55.370
Or rather, I don't really like drawing attention to-

00:02:57.290 --> 00:02:58.910
Well, of course you don't.

00:02:58.910 --> 00:03:02.370
Between the two of you, you'd get
the booby prize in the chest department!

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:05.700
H-hey! Don't touch me in such a weird place!

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:08.080
Chill out! It's not like they'll get smaller.

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:09.200
M-my nose is bleeding...

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:14.200
Note: "Akuma" means demon

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:14.200
A-an akuma!

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:16.660
I-I mean, it's Takuma Akutsu-kun.

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:18.120
Wh-what's wrong?

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:21.750
S-Sorry.

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:24.540
We were too rowdy and loud, weren't we?

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:26.790
So...u-um...

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:29.790
I don't really mind.

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:31.950
Please forgive me!

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:34.040
Yamada fell out of the window!

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:38.000
How many is that today?

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:41.250
There's an ambulance on standby
outside of the main gate.

00:03:40.540 --> 00:03:41.250
Huh?

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:43.040
Keep it down!

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:46.120
Don't just stand there yammerin' away to...

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:47.660
An akuma?!

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:51.790
I mean, Akutsu, have you done it again?

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:57.290
I see! That was my misunderstanding, huh?

00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:59.500
Well then, I'll be heading back!

00:03:59.660 --> 00:04:01.910
Silence

00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:07.830
That was scary. I thought he was gonna get killed!

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:10.450
That Akuma guy's just having a free for all today.

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:15.040
You think he's the culprit of those
serial "akuma" incidents?

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:17.660
Serial "Akuma" Incidents

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:17.450
The serial "akuma" incidents...

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:30.700
Investigators closing in on a mystery!
Special report - Akuma have come to the city!

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:20.700
The stuff they've been covering on the news lately?

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:24.790
Some guy wearing a demon mask
attacked pedestrians!

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:26.660
I can believe he'd do it.

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:29.830
I heard that even though he lives alone,
you can hear a lot of voices coming from his house!

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:30.700
Freaky!

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:34.910
Natsuki, you keep your distance from that guy, too...

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:37.370
Natsuki, is something wrong?

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:41.160
No, it's nothing.

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:45.700
He's so creepy.

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:46.750
It's Akuma.

00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:48.790
What's that book he's reading?

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:49.250
He should just

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:51.290
He should just hurry up and disappear.

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:49.750
He should just
hurry up

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:51.290
He should just
hurry up
and disappear.

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:53.160
Hey, he can hear you.

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:55.000
But it's all his fault...

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:56.290
Student Council President

00:04:57.540 --> 00:04:59.370
What might all this commotion be?

00:04:59.950 --> 00:05:02.620
Student Council President, it's that guy.

00:05:02.620 --> 00:05:05.330
It looks like Akuma is causing problems again.

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:05.870
It's the Student Council President!

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:07.290
She's so cool!

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:07.910
Since the school festival is coming up,

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:10.700
I thought it'd be awful if we had
even more problems come up now.

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:15.200
You mustn't do that, Matsumura-san.

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:16.080
Huh?

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:20.540
This is something that can only be corrected by
the student council at that time.

00:05:20.950 --> 00:05:24.700
The student council must not be the chain
by which the students are tied down.

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:29.290
For the sake of the students and
the academy, let's all do our best...

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:33.200
Vice President Matsumura.

00:05:33.290 --> 00:05:34.950
Ba-dump

00:05:35.700 --> 00:05:38.580
Lovely... the Student Council President is just so lovely!

00:05:38.580 --> 00:05:42.160
I'm definitely voting for her in the beauty contest!

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:48.290
Besides, I don't think that person is an akuma.

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:53.410
He looks more like a cowardly child.

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:56.750
Scary... Is that an akuma?

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:57.790
He's looking over here!

00:05:57.790 --> 00:06:00.040
Let's go so we don't get involved in those incidents.

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:08.870
I'm not an akuma at all, though.

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:14.410
This "Akuma" is Takuma Akutsu, 16,
who was once a normal boy.

00:06:14.660 --> 00:06:16.290
Flashback

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:16.290
True, however...

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:19.290
Kindergarten

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:19.080
Hey c'mon, let's play dodge ball!

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:23.290
Shock
Shock

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:21.250
Uh... With you, Akutsu-kun?

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:23.290
Sorry, I'm kinda scared to.

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:27.290
Due to his intimidating air, everyone has been
scared of him since early childhood.

00:06:27.290 --> 00:06:33.290
Elementary School

00:06:27.290 --> 00:06:30.080
Everyone that approached him was like that.

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:31.540
Why the hell you lookin' at us like that?!

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:33.290
You tryin' to pick a fight, fool?!

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:38.910
No entry
Do not engage
Stay away

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:38.910
As a result, he stopped directly interacting
with others and developed a phobia of humans.

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:44.250
Just like earlier when I stood up a little,
they'd get surprised and fall of the window.

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:47.540
And even when I want to deny it,
I'm so petrified I can't say anything.

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:48.790
I'm sick of this.

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:53.200
Today's guest is the currently
insanely popular Mutsumi-chan!

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:56.330
You've been so busy lately you don't even
have time to hang out with friends, right?

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:58.330
That isn't true!

00:06:58.580 --> 00:07:01.080
Our high school campus festival is coming up soon,

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:03.330
and I've been really looking forward to it!

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:06.540
I promised my friends that I'd
walk around with them there.

00:07:06.540 --> 00:07:10.330
About the culture festival, Mutsumi-chan,
will you be in charge of any of the events there?

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:14.700
I don't need any friends.

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:17.000
I sincerely believe that.

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:20.040
As long as I have that one thing, I'm okay.

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:21.450
What I need is...

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:24.700
High School Exams
Complete Preparations in 30 days - Revised edition
Common Questions on the Exam
Math Workbook
150 carefully-selected questions

00:07:22.910 --> 00:07:24.330
my studies!

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:29.620
I got this correct.

00:07:30.330 --> 00:07:31.830
This is correct, too.

00:07:31.830 --> 00:07:32.830
What do we do?

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:34.450
Like I would know...

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:36.000
And these, too.

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:37.450
We should go to the police!

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:39.160
But he's just sitting there.

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:41.200
Correct!

00:07:41.330 --> 00:07:43.450
Shock

00:07:41.330 --> 00:07:43.120
Akuma!

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:48.040
Jeez, they almost gave me a heart attack
with all the sudden shouting.

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:50.080
Hello, is this the police?!

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:52.700
There's an Akuma engrossed in
reading his book of spells!

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:58.870
I want to study by myself.

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:02.120
Nothing good comes from
interacting with other people.

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:09.000
This house that my parents left to me
is the only place I can be alone.

00:08:11.950 --> 00:08:13.870
Or so I thought...

00:08:14.120 --> 00:08:15.500
T...Takuma-kun?

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:17.290
Oh my, welcome home.

00:08:18.370 --> 00:08:19.410
Disgraceful!

00:08:23.660 --> 00:08:26.790
Ugh, just how many times do you jerks have to

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:29.790
do these disgraceful things before you're satisfied?!

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:31.290
Natsuki Saotome

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:31.290
You pervert!

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:33.450
I-I-I'm leaving now!

00:08:34.950 --> 00:08:38.950
Oh my, Takuma-san, let's talk a little more.

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:41.000
S-Student Council President?!

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:44.000
I don't like how stiff that sounds.

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:47.000
Will you call me "Itsuyo"?

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:47.000
Itsuyo Saotome

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:49.950
And don't make that face, either.

00:08:50.910 --> 00:08:52.750
Hey!

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:55.790
Wh-what're you doing?! Get away from her!

00:08:55.790 --> 00:08:58.330
Aren't you going to get dressed first, Itsuyo?!

00:08:58.330 --> 00:09:01.080
It doesn't matter what I'm going to do, does it?

00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:06.410
Well, it is inevitable that someone like you with
such a depressing chest would be jealous, though.

00:09:06.410 --> 00:09:08.750
The size of my chest has nothing to do with this!

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:10.700
And I'm not jealous of you at all!

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:13.040
Oh? Do you want me to tie you up?

00:09:13.040 --> 00:09:14.700
Now's my chance!

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:18.120
Mutsumi Saotome

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:19.620
Ah, no!

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:23.660
I can't do it today! I get so sweaty after a live show!

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:32.790
Oh, Natsuki, you still wear childish ones like that?

00:09:32.790 --> 00:09:34.790
I'm so sorry, you two!

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:39.450
How many times must you do these
disgraceful things before you're satisfied?

00:09:39.450 --> 00:09:40.950
I-I'm sorry!

00:09:40.950 --> 00:09:43.290
Oh, it's Takumatchi! Welcome home!

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:44.120
Misa Saotome

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:44.120
Yakumo Saotome

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:44.120
Sue

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:45.200
Welcome back.

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:49.000
What's up with him?

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:50.540
I don't know.

00:09:54.700 --> 00:09:56.620
Right now, this house...

00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:59.790
is being controlled by nine women!

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:04.410
They're like demons on an all-out rage fest
that just showed up out of nowhere.

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:07.330
I was completely enjoying my
carefully-crafted life alone,

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:09.620
but now I can't even concentrate on studying.

00:10:09.620 --> 00:10:12.040
Since it's come to this, I'm gonna call the police!

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:14.700
Are you saying you want us to leave?

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:19.000
Futaba Saotome

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:19.000
Kururi Saotome

00:10:17.620 --> 00:10:18.790
Yo!

00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:23.870
Since you allowed us to
so brazenly occupy your home,

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:27.620
if this is what you have decided, we will obey.

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:29.000
We will.

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:33.620
However, what would our dear father say,
were we to return home empty handed as we are?

00:10:33.620 --> 00:10:34.830
We are!

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:38.160
You don't have to leave.

00:10:38.160 --> 00:10:39.500
Hooray!

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:42.000
Really? Thank goodness.

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:46.700
By the way, why aren't they all
afraid of being around me?

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:46.700
Big Bro Takuma, let's play! Big Bro Takuma?

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:48.910
This is too scary!

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:51.950
Concerning the frequent demon incidents,

00:10:51.950 --> 00:10:54.330
the police are having a hard time
with their investigation.

00:10:54.330 --> 00:10:56.540
They have yet to obtain any clues on the matter.

00:10:55.450 --> 00:10:57.330
Pass the soy sauce!

00:10:57.500 --> 00:10:58.660
Here you go!

00:11:00.620 --> 00:11:02.330
Mutsumi, what about work today?

00:11:02.330 --> 00:11:03.330
I'm off.

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:05.160
My, that's rare.

00:11:05.160 --> 00:11:06.290
More, please!

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:09.290
Takuma-chan, you haven't even
touched your chopsticks.

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:12.160
Sue-chan

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:10.750
Oh, uh...

00:11:12.450 --> 00:11:14.620
I'm afraid of people!

00:11:14.620 --> 00:11:16.580
I don't want to associate with other people!

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:18.750
I just want to study by myself!

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:20.370
The entrance exams are next year, you know!

00:11:20.370 --> 00:11:23.160
So please, leave my house right now!

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:25.870
I could never say something like that, though.

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:27.080
More, please!

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:31.750
I wonder how I can get them to leave peacefully...

00:11:32.450 --> 00:11:35.160
If this keeps up, it will affect
my entrance exam studies...

00:11:46.580 --> 00:11:49.000
Has Natsuki-chan piqued your interest?

00:11:50.500 --> 00:11:52.620
There's a hole in the wall!

00:11:54.330 --> 00:11:56.330
If that's the case...

00:11:57.120 --> 00:11:59.120
Why did this happen?

00:11:59.120 --> 00:12:03.040
Natsuki-san is always angry and I can't deal with her.

00:12:03.040 --> 00:12:05.120
I want to be alone as soon as possible.

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:09.450
What is it?

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:11.040
N-nothing.

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:13.790
Were you always wearing glasses?

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:16.200
Are you making fun of me?

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:18.250
I only wear them when I'm studying.

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:22.040
Glasses are something you wear
when studying, right?

00:12:22.040 --> 00:12:23.950
So, they're just for show.

00:12:22.330 --> 00:12:23.450
Just for show

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:28.910
Do you really hate it that much?

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:33.500
Do you hate studying with me?

00:12:34.410 --> 00:12:38.000
Yes! If at all possible, I want to study by myself!

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:41.790
You idiot! Just get on with it!

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:44.370
I will not go along with this!

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:47.910
Itsuyo-chan, you're as aggressive as always!

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:49.700
Don't act like that, Itsuyo.

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:51.870
We all decided on this beforehand.

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:53.040
She's right.

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:56.120
We said that we'd give priority to
raising Natsuki-chan's level.

00:12:57.330 --> 00:13:01.200
Itsuyo, cheer up! I'll give you candy later.

00:13:02.160 --> 00:13:05.410
More importantly, is Big Brother okay?

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:07.700
He goes on and on about studying,

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:11.450
and I don't feel he's motivated to do
the most crucial thing.

00:13:11.870 --> 00:13:13.200
Oh really?

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:15.160
I totally get it.

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:17.620
He's completely unmotivated by that.

00:13:18.870 --> 00:13:20.910
You need to show some motivation too!

00:13:21.370 --> 00:13:25.000
I'm not worried about anything in regards to that.

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:31.410
After all, Takuma-san is the man
that our father approves of.

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:37.250
I'm so nervous I can't concentrate on studying.

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:40.000
Calm down... I need to calm down.

00:13:42.330 --> 00:13:45.250
I have to focus more. Focus...

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:47.080
FOCUS!

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:50.450
Of all places, that's where it chooses to go...

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:52.370
What do I do?

00:13:52.370 --> 00:13:54.080
What is the meaning of this?

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:57.000
I even put on glasses like Dad said to, but...

00:13:57.370 --> 00:14:00.370
Math IIA
Class (2-D) Name (Natsuki Saotome)

00:13:57.540 --> 00:14:00.080
I don't understand this problem at all!

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:02.620
And what on earth is up with math?

00:14:02.620 --> 00:14:05.290
Do I really need this type of thing?

00:14:05.500 --> 00:14:07.750
Trig...Trigonometric function?

00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:10.200
Is that some sort of esoteric technique?

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:15.250
Disgraceful!

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:16.200
I'b shorry!

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:18.620
I was trying to get my eraser...

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:21.910
Are you seriously even motivated to do this?!

00:14:25.660 --> 00:14:27.000
I am.

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:31.160
I promised my deceased mother.

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:37.790
I said I'd study... and become...

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:40.580
become a respectable person.

00:14:43.410 --> 00:14:47.870
Are the two of you just about done studying?

00:14:47.870 --> 00:14:50.040
Come and take a little break.

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:57.950
Why is this happening again...

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:01.790
I accidentally forgot to buy toilet paper,

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:04.410
so I'd like you two to go get some.

00:15:04.410 --> 00:15:06.790
Oh right, when you do this,

00:15:06.790 --> 00:15:10.080
you must hold hands and go shopping.

00:15:10.290 --> 00:15:12.080
Make sure you don't forget, okay?

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:15.620
I want to go home now.

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:20.040
This is a notice to all residents of the neighborhood.

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:23.950
There have been many dangerous incidents
occurring around this area.

00:15:23.950 --> 00:15:26.700
Please refrain from going out at night.

00:15:27.200 --> 00:15:31.330
You know they suspect that you're the culprit
in the akuma incidents, right?

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:32.290
Huh?

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:37.660
It's because they see an incident in the classroom,
and you let everyone continue to misunderstand it.

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:40.870
Why don't you even try to defend yourself.

00:15:43.160 --> 00:15:45.870
It'd be pointless to do that.

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:49.160
My face is scary and my body is big.

00:15:49.160 --> 00:15:53.910
I only cause problems, so I can't do anything
about being treated like a criminal.

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:56.330
Is she angry?!

00:15:56.620 --> 00:16:00.330
Speaking of the akuma incidents,
they were right around here, right?

00:16:00.330 --> 00:16:03.660
And the place where you saved my life...

00:16:03.830 --> 00:16:05.910
Yeah... it was.

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:08.910
Seeing you right now, I get annoyed.

00:16:09.330 --> 00:16:11.330
I-I'm sorry.

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:13.250
Even though back then,

00:16:14.540 --> 00:16:17.540
you were... so cool.

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:27.290
An akuma!

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:30.830
What is that?

00:16:30.830 --> 00:16:31.790
Is this for TV?

00:16:44.200 --> 00:16:45.410
It disappeared?

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:48.950
It seems they've safely deployed the barrier.

00:16:49.370 --> 00:16:50.790
It's huge!

00:16:51.370 --> 00:16:55.910
This summon brought a much stronger one
compared to the previous ones.

00:16:55.910 --> 00:17:00.160
Does this mean that Father's oracle
is one hundred percent true?

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:03.540
Huh? What do we do?

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:06.700
It doesn't look like Natsuki can
defeat it at her current level,

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:08.540
but we have to believe in her.

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:12.700
You can do it, Natsuki-chan, Takuma-kun.

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:18.330
This is definitely a Hrugnir!

00:17:18.580 --> 00:17:21.910
I can't believe such a high-level
demon was summoned!

00:17:21.910 --> 00:17:24.660
I can't buy us any extra time for the barrier!

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:26.250
What do I do?

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:30.330
I'll lose the opportunity to raise my level
if I hold hands and shop.

00:17:31.120 --> 00:17:34.250
Then, we have to do it the other way...

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:37.120
It's impossible to get rid of this akuma!

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:38.450
Let's just run for it!

00:17:38.450 --> 00:17:40.950
What a loathsome thing to say at a time like this.

00:17:40.950 --> 00:17:42.910
That's really the type of man he is.

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:44.830
Find somewhere and take cover!

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:45.660
Okay!

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:47.290
I really hate him.

00:18:01.450 --> 00:18:04.000
Hey, get ahold of yourself! Hey!

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:06.370
You protected me? Why?

00:18:07.410 --> 00:18:08.790
I knew it.
I knew it.

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:11.660
Nothing good comes from
being involved with other people.

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:11.660
Nothing good comes from being
involved with other people.

00:18:11.660 --> 00:18:14.160
I'm okay with being alone my whole life.

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:15.950
I wholeheartedly believe that.

00:18:15.250 --> 00:18:17.160
Yay! C'mon, this way!

00:18:17.870 --> 00:18:18.750
Wait!

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:20.160
And yet...

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:24.290
My body had moved before I realized it.

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:32.410
This is how you really are.

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:34.830
Nothing's changed at all.

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:38.290
Natsuki-san, get out of here and get someone to help!

00:18:38.790 --> 00:18:40.000
I can't.

00:18:40.450 --> 00:18:42.950
That demon can't be defeated by humans.

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:46.750
This is my first time...

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:50.370
So... be gentle with me.

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:09.080
"Hold hands and go shopping"

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:09.870
"Hold hands and go shopping," cancelled.

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:09.870
Failed

00:19:10.700 --> 00:19:13.330
Val x Love "Massage chest" complete.

00:19:13.580 --> 00:19:15.200
Entering experience points.

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:17.830
Siegrune level up confirmed,

00:19:17.830 --> 00:19:20.580
and "Kiss with a Lover" acknowledged.

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:22.370
Valkyrie, invoked.

00:19:25.250 --> 00:19:27.000
As told in the myths,

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:31.330
in Asgard's Valhalla, there live
goddesses called Valkyries.

00:19:32.200 --> 00:19:34.290
Natsuki-san...

00:19:34.950 --> 00:19:38.410
Valkyries grow stronger as long as they are in love.

00:19:39.910 --> 00:19:41.910
The reason being that, love is...

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:51.000
the source of a maiden's power.

00:19:55.160 --> 00:19:57.080
Alright! They did pretty good!

00:19:57.080 --> 00:19:57.950
Yeah.

00:19:58.290 --> 00:19:59.950
This is great, Itsuyo-chan!

00:19:59.950 --> 00:20:02.410
Of course they'd be able to do at least that.

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:04.950
Did you see that?

00:20:04.950 --> 00:20:07.580
Takuma-chan is doing his best.

00:20:07.870 --> 00:20:11.080
Why don't you give it up
and show your face around here,

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:12.580
Big Sister Ichika?

00:20:12.830 --> 00:20:15.700
Hmph. Three-hundred twenty-eight seconds.

00:20:15.700 --> 00:20:18.750
If he needs that much time to vanquish a demon,

00:20:18.750 --> 00:20:20.950
then his spirit is too weak.

00:20:21.500 --> 00:20:26.370
I could never recognize such a weakling
as the lover of us sisters.

00:20:41.500 --> 00:20:45.120
Currently, this world is in grave danger of destruction.

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:47.450
Brave young man,

00:20:47.450 --> 00:20:51.500
you should surely understand this personally now.

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:56.160
At this rate, in not even a few days' time,
this world will be enveloped in flame.

00:20:56.160 --> 00:21:00.660
This world, this land of Midgard...
I want you to protect it from the akuma's grasp.

00:21:00.660 --> 00:21:02.080
Who are you?

00:21:02.080 --> 00:21:05.620
I am Odin, ruler of the gods of Asgard.

00:21:05.620 --> 00:21:08.500
You will need a sword to win this battle.

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.580
I will bestow one upon you.

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:12.700
There are nine sacred swords.

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:14.870
The nine beautiful, young Valkyries.

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:17.750
As long as a Valkyrie is in love,
she will grow stronger.

00:21:18.830 --> 00:21:21.540
You will become the Valkyries' lover.

00:21:18.830 --> 00:21:21.540
Second Daughter: Futaba
"Gerhilde"
Castle Lv. 12

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:21.540
Eldest Daughter: Ichika
"Brunhilde"
Spear Lv. 1

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:24.540
Third Daughter: Misa
"Ortlinde"
String Lv. 6

00:21:22.750 --> 00:21:24.540
You will fall in love with them.

00:21:23.540 --> 00:21:24.540
Fourth Daughter: Shino
"Waltraute"
Armor Lv. 2

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:27.540
Sixth Daughter: Mutsumi
"Helmwige"
Wing Lv. 5

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:27.540
Grow, and refine yourself.

00:21:26.540 --> 00:21:27.540
Fifth Daughter: Itsuyo
"Shwertleite"
Chain Lv. 5

00:21:28.540 --> 00:21:30.540
Ninth Daughter: Kururi
"Rossweisse"
Canon Lv. 9

00:21:28.700 --> 00:21:30.540
You must show proof...

00:21:29.540 --> 00:21:30.540
Eighth Daughter: Yakumo
"Grimgerde"
Sound Lv. 4

00:21:31.160 --> 00:21:35.500
Seventh Daughter:
Natsuki
"Siegrune"
Blade Lv. 20

00:21:31.750 --> 00:21:34.830
Love is what will save the world!

00:23:06.200 --> 00:23:09.330
We managed to defeat the akuma
this time around, but to fight well,

00:23:09.330 --> 00:23:12.250
it's important to raise our levels higher than normal
so this won't happen again.

00:23:12.250 --> 00:23:14.910
Okay. The Val Love sure have a lot of different levels.

00:23:14.910 --> 00:23:17.370
What does that mean? Do you have
some sort of objection to being our lovers?

00:23:17.370 --> 00:23:20.660
Not at all! I'm just wondering why I was chosen.

00:23:20.660 --> 00:23:25.450
The ruler of the gods of Asgard, who's my papa...
my Father, accepted you as the one.

00:23:25.620 --> 00:23:30.580
In any case, as our lover Einherjar,
you will raise the levels of my sisters and I.

00:23:30.580 --> 00:23:34.950
And if we don't kiss you to start with,
we cannot manifest the true power of the Valkyries.

00:23:34.950 --> 00:23:36.700
All this pressure makes my stomach hurt...

00:23:37.790 --> 00:23:40.540
Next time: 
The Binding Maiden

00:23:37.790 --> 00:23:39.910
Next time: "The Binding Maiden."
